{"id":"659990","name":"生地土茯汤","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/659990/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪骨","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"生地","amount":"30g"},{"name":"土茯","amount":"30g"},{"name":"麦冬","amount":"10g"},{"name":"陈皮","amount":"一片"},{"name":"蜜枣","amount":"一颗"},{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪翼骨放入盐和淀粉抓拌，再用水彻底清洗干净。","img":"images/659990/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"要有生地、土茯、麦冬、陈皮、蜜枣、姜片，生地洗干净后切成薄片。","img":"images/659990/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪骨凉水入锅，放入姜片，倒入料酒。","img":"images/659990/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"焯水五分钟后捞出，再清洗干净。","img":"images/659990/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"砂锅内加入水，倒入猪骨。","img":"images/659990/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入汤料。","img":"images/659990/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"大火烧开。","img":"images/659990/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"打去表面的浮沫。","img":"images/659990/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"盖上盖，小火煲60分钟。","img":"images/659990/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"时间到。","img":"images/659990/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"猪骨已软绵脱骨，加入盐调味就可以了。","img":"images/659990/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品。夏日除湿汤。","img":"images/659990/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}